  "definition": "External Floating Roof VOC Storage Tanks",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-05-01",
  "historyNote": "#7788, eff 10-31-02; ss by #9802, eff 10-31-10 (from Env-A 804.19); ss by #12762, eff 5-1-19",
